# Offline search exploration: keep code, briefs, notes and the scoreboard; ignore generated/intermediate outputs.
# Run outputs (per-decision npz, per-cell json, batch logs, oracle cache) — only the scoreboard is tracked.
results/*
!results/scoreboard.csv
# smoke runs, scratch dirs and caches written by methods / tools
**/_smoke/
**/smoke/
**/smoke_*.txt
**/scratch/
**/_cache/
**/__pycache__/
# raw arrays never belong in the tree (big arrays live under the store's derived/ dir)
*.npz
*.npy
*.log
